0 Amplify — one-motor 2:1 pantograph
0 Name: amplify.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under the BSD-3-Clause license; see ../licenses/amplify.txt.
0 // Original native arrangement. One motor on hub port A.
0 // Four linked bars copy a circular input at exactly twice its planar scale.
0 // All seven ordinary hinges use retained physical shafts; no output guide.
0 // External standard part meshes are referenced, not embedded.
